Z||000050||KathyHL||10-24-2001||07:39 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>I usually get off I-75 to get to Kettering, whats some directions? Maybe Ill talk Lisa into coming, also note that there calling for snow flurries fri nite.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Roger:<BR>Get off at the Springboro Pike exit(near the GM Plant) & bear left. Go north on Springboro Pike till you get to Dorothy Lane (about 3/4 mile from ramp, there will be a sign that says "Kettering 1/2 mile". Now, your gonna take Dorothy Lane a good 3-4 miles. As soon as you see Wilmington Pike, your only about another mile away. Look for a Bob Evans and Morris Furniture on your right and. We are that traffice light by Morris furn is where we will be (Sears Hardware). Hope to see you and Lisa there!||||reg||1
