Z||000054||KathyHL||10-24-2001||07:54 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by tomanyfieros:<BR><B>i know this sounds funnny, i am 15 miles away form Reality.... what day? what time? LMK<BR>Thanx Jason<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Geez, Jason! That was quick! The day is this Friday at 6:00PM in Kettering behind Sears Hardware at Woodman Drive and Dorothy Lane. If you take I think it's RT50 to Chillicothe and hit US35 west to Dayton. Get off at the Woodman Drive Exit and go left on Woodman. You will travel South about 4 miles. Look for Value City Dept store on you left and a Frisches Restr on your right. That is Patterson Rd. Keep going south on Woodman about another mile and a half and the next major intersection is Dorothy Lane. Turn right and ElderBeermans and SearsHardware will immidiately be on your left...your there!!<BR>||||reg||1
